#. habla: PANACHE
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "#126"
msgid "WELL THAT WAS A SURPRISE! DREAMY BONNY WAS THE ONE THAT STOLE CAPTAIN MATTHEWS' SHIP'S LOG! WE MUST FIND HER AND GET BACK THE SHIP'S LOG!"
msgstr "¡VAYA SORPRESA! ¡DREAMY BONNY FUE LA QUE ROBÓ LA BITÁCORA DE LA NAVE DEL CAPITÁN MATTHEWS! ¡TENEMOS QUE ENCONTRARLA Y RECUPERAR LA BITÁCORA!"

#. habla: PANACHE
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "#127"
msgid "PLEASE TAKE THIS! THOUGH I DON'T KNOW IF IT'LL BE USEFUL."
msgstr "¡POR FAVOR, ACEPTA ESTO! AUNQUE NO SÉ SI TE SERVIRÁ."

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "#128"
msgid "You can now use the Double Attack \"Fiery Ritornelle\"! Fiery Ritornelle is a Double Attack for Ziggy and Jr."
